// A choice visited three times: an @once option goes, and a hand-written answer counts it anyway.

@actor mira
    name: Mira

@var $key = false
@tag show_disabled

== c.main
-> Sticky #id:c01
    mira: Sticky. #id:c11
-> Once  @once #id:c02
    mira: Once. #id:c12
-> Third #id:c03
    mira: Third. #id:c13
-> Gate  @if $key #show_disabled #id:c04
    mira: Gate. #id:c14
-> No ID here
    mira: Fallback.
@if visits(c.main) < 3
    @jump c.main
